+The route entrypoint (`UsersRolesConfigurationPage.tsx`) is now a **thin wrapper** — it renders `AccessWorkspaceSurface`, a four-chapter Access product workspace (Collection → Selected → Focused Workspace shell) gated on `canManage` (org admin, or the `settings.users_roles` permission). The retired two-tab `UsersRolesSettingsClient` is gone. The four chapters are:
