+| Chapter | Component | State |
+|---|---|---|
+| **Users** | `AccessUsersConfigurationPage` | Live — user list, person link, primary-role assignment, access scope (dept/site). |
+| **Roles** | `AccessRolesConfigurationPage` | Live — role catalog rail + per-role workspace (tabs: Overview / Permissions / Users / **Experience Access** / **History**). |
+| **Access Scopes** | `AccessScopesPage` | Live — data-visibility scope (department/site), orthogonal to capability grants. |
+| **Security** | `AccessSecurityPage` | Live — authentication / security surface. |
+
